{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sUtBKoAcLT1794821885.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>女子佩劍世界盃埃及開羅站，港隊團體賽歷史性奪銅。</p><p></p><p>薛雅齊、朱詠翹、劉綺程及曾悅澄組成的港隊，先贏東道主埃及及世界第二的世錦賽冠軍匈牙利，八強再殺退波蘭，四強不敵韓國後，落入銅牌戰，鬥世界第六的美國。八局後領先1分，憑「守尾門」的薛雅齊單局打出5-0，排名16的港隊贏45-39，創歷史奪得香港首面佩劍世界盃獎牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.615845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:12.636237+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:41.679812+00:00","content_hash":"ce8998b66f3a108b2ace736bbcb9d7ae3426cd58db10a2742d4c489267b8b258","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.615845+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}